## 📁 File Inventory

| File | Purpose | Key Responsibilities |
|------|---------|---------------------|
| `server.js` | Backend server | Express + WebSocket orchestration, REST API, worker status management, batch loop controller, console log redirection to UI |
| `register.js` | Automation engine | Per-email Playwright Firefox automation, proxy/VPN lifecycle (Warp/Psiphon/Socks5/Direct), fingerprint evasion, form filling, Dropbox daemon spawning & CLI linking |
| `db.js` | Data layer | JSON-file persistence for registration records and app settings (`history.json`) |
| `fingerprint-check.js` | Diagnostic tool | Opens a browser, extracts 20+ fingerprint fields (navigator.webdriver, canvas, WebGL, plugins, etc.), reports risks against bot detectors |
| `public/index.html` | Frontend UI | Tabbed dashboard: Progress view (ring chart, stats, console log) + Settings view (target, email, password, timeout/retry, proxy/VPN config) |
| `public/index.css` | Styling | Glassmorphism dark theme with CSS custom properties, responsive layout |
| `psiphon.config` | Psiphon VPN config | JSON config for psiphon-tunnel-core binary (region selection, etc.) |
| `setup.sh` | One-command installer | Auto-installs npm deps, Playwright Firefox, downloads Dropbox daemon & Psiphon binary |

