## 💾 Data Model (history.json)

```jsonc
{
  "registrations": [
    {
      "id": 1720185600000,       // timestamp-based ID
      "email": "john.doe42@kywa.uk",
      "password": "Aa12345678*",
      "status": "success",        // "success" | "failed" | "VERIF"
      "alias": "Worker-01",       // worker label
      "ip": "203.0.113.42",       // public IP used
      "ua": "Mozilla/5.0 ...",    // user agent string
      "timeouts": 0,              // timeout count for this email
      "errors": 0,                // error count for this email
      "timestamp": "2026-07-05T12:30:00.000Z"
    }
  ],
  "settings": {
    "idleTimeout": 180            // seconds before worker goes IDLE
  }
}
```

