## ⚙️ Configuration Options (UI Settings)

| Category | Setting | Default | Description |
|----------|---------|---------|-------------|
| **Target** | Alias Worker | `Alias1` | Label for this batch run |
| **Target** | Dropbox URL | `https://www.dropbox.com/register` | Registration page URL (supports referral links) |
| **Email** | Source Mode | `manual` | `manual` = semicolon-separated list; `auto` = generated from domain |
| **Email** | Domain | `kywa.uk` | Domain for auto-generated emails |
| **Email** | Count | `10` | Number of emails to generate (auto mode) |
| **Password** | Mode | `random` | `random` = 12-char complex; `fixed` = user-provided |
| **Timeout** | Global Timeout | `30s` | Max seconds per registration step |
| **Timeout** | Global Retry | `3` | Max browser retry attempts per phase |
| **Timeout** | Daemon Timeout | `120s` | Max seconds to wait for Dropbox CLI link URL |
| **Worker** | Idle Timeout | `180s` | Seconds of inactivity before worker goes IDLE |

