## 🖥️ External Dependencies (Not in npm)

These are downloaded/installed via `setup.sh` or manually:

| Binary / Tool | Purpose | Platform |
|---------------|---------|----------|
| **Firefox** (via Playwright) | Browser automation target | Cross-platform |
| **Dropbox Daemon** (`dropbox-lnx.x86_64`) | Device linking after registration | Linux x86_64 / Android (box64) |
| **Psiphon Tunnel Core** (`psiphon-tunnel-core-x86_64`) | VPN proxy with region rotation | Linux x86_64 |
| **warp-ctl** | Cloudflare Warp CLI for IP rotation | Linux |
| **Docker** (optional) | Runs Dropbox daemon in isolated container on Ubuntu x86_64 | Linux |
| **box64** (Android/Termux) | x86_64 emulation layer for running Dropbox daemon on ARM Android | Android |

