## 🚀 Quick Start

```bash
# One-command setup (Linux/Android)
curl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jacksatriadi-jpg/Dropbox/webui/setup.sh | bash
cd Dropbox

# Or manual setup
npm install
npx playwright install firefox

# Run the server
node server.js

# Open in browser
# http://localhost:3000
```

