## 🐧 Supported Platforms

| Platform | Dropbox Daemon Execution | Notes |
|----------|------------------------|-------|
| **Linux x86_64 (native)** | Direct via bash/box64 | Standard execution |
| **Ubuntu x86_64** | Docker container (`ubuntu:24.04`) | Isolated, safer daemon execution |
| **Android (Termux)** | box64 emulation | Requires `setup.sh` headless config |

